    <!-- Manual Activity strings -->
    <string name="title_manual">App Manual</string>
    <string name="manual_dashboard_title">1. Dashboard Overview</string>
    <string name="manual_dashboard_desc">The dashboard is your financial command center. See your total balance ("In My Pocket"), income, and expenses at a glance. The progress bar changes color based on your spending: Green (Safe), Yellow (Caution), and Red (Over Limit).</string>
    <string name="manual_expenses_title">2. Logging Spending</string>
    <string name="manual_expenses_desc">Tap the \'+ icon\' on the bottom bar to add an expense. Enter the amount, description, and category. You can also upload a photo of your receipt to keep digital records of your purchases.</string>
    <string name="manual_budgeting_title">3. Setting Goals</string>
    <string name="manual_budgeting_desc">Use the \'Budget tab\' (target icon) to define your monthly income, minimum savings goal, and maximum spending limit. Pennywise uses these to track your financial health automatically.</string>
    <string name="manual_reports_title">4. Reports &amp; Statements</string>
    <string name="manual_reports_desc">Access \'Reports\' from the side menu to view category breakdowns and transaction history. Filter by date range to analyze specific periods, and use the \'Download Statement\' button to save a text report of your spending.</string>
    <string name="manual_gamification_title">5. Achievements &amp; XP</string>
    <string name="manual_gamification_desc">Earn XP by staying consistent! Log expenses (+10 XP) and set budgets (+50 XP) to level up from Financial Novice to Wealth Builder. Check the \'Progress\' tab to see your journey map and unlock unique badges.</string>
    <string name="manual_profile_title">6. Profile &amp; Customization</string>
    <string name="manual_profile_desc">Personalize your experience in the \'Profile\' section. Upload a profile picture, update your username, and track your badges. Visit \'Settings\' to manage notifications or clear your transaction history if you want a fresh start.</string>
    <string name="manual_offline_title">7. Offline Access &amp; Privacy</string>
    <string name="manual_offline_desc">PennyWise stores all your financial data locally on your device. This means your sensitive information stays private and you can log expenses even without an internet connection.</string>
    <string name="manual_tips_title">8. Tips for Success</string>
    <string name="manual_tips_desc">For the most accurate tracking, try to log expenses as soon as they happen. Don\'t forget to check your \'Report\' weekly to spot trends and adjust your \'Budget Goals\' if you find yourself consistently over-spending in certain categories.</string>

